# Log a record at every level, each message naming its level.
#
+cat <<EOI >=input
error error: e
warning warning: w
notice n
info i
debug d
trace-l1 t1
trace-l2 t2
trace-l3 t3
EOI

: default
: Test that the default verbosity writes warnings and high-level information
:
$* <=../input 2>>EOE
error: e
warning: w
n
EOE

: verbosity
: Test the levels written at each verbosity
:
{{
  $* 0 <=../../input 2>>EOE : quiet
  error: e
  EOE

  $* 2 <=../../input 2>>EOE : progress
  error: e
  warning: w
  n
  i
  EOE

  $* 3 <=../../input 2>>EOE : detail
  error: e
  warning: w
  n
  i
  d
  EOE

  $* 6 <=../../input 2>>EOE : trace
  error: e
  warning: w
  n
  i
  d
  t1
  t2
  t3
  EOE
}}

: endpoint-prefix
: Test that the message is written as is, without quill's metadata
:
$* <'warning 127.0.0.1:5000: warning: request too large' 2>>EOE
127.0.0.1:5000: warning: request too large
EOE
